# speakeasy5 (Guttersnipe: The Baleful Backwash, Bitter Karella, ASL 550): full win (Finished, no clock). Derived from the game source.
# Cell: rope from the barrels + keg pushed + mousehole matchbook, rope into the still, light it -> door blows. Printing room: switch on press, take the covers (used mechanically as the poker "hand"), sit on the stool in the poker room -> key; `open padlock` (not `unlock`) in the hallway; alley: open trashcan, take boots, eat boots -> shoelaces.
# Restaurant: Sauce American bottle, `ask patron about intestines` then take intestines (guts); kitchen plate + shoelaces + sauce -> "spaghetti"; Tony then Papa Macaroni accept it. Backstage: record from the trunk, guts to Hellbender -> he goes on stage, so the victrola can be taken. Statue is hidechildren: `x` it first, then take the coin (moll distracted); coin into the mason jar on stage sends the moll to the dance floor.
# Cell2 (hallway2 north): `use record on victrola` removes Murray -> rotgut -> welded door (`use rotgut on welded door`) -> maintenance room `turn valve` unlocks the restroom -> Burma Shave -> `use burma shave on statue` in the office -> requisition note -> Skinny Vinnie (armory, SE of backroom) -> Chicago typewriter (one bullet) -> `shoot pigeon` in the alley, take it, `give dead pigeon to dog` in the bar (west of the dance floor), take jingleball -> `challenge ferret` ONLY with the jingleball (a first challenge without it is a lost fight) -> golden file -> `open cage with golden file` in the kennel (Percy) -> atrium (Tony + goons) `shoot tony` (bluff, bullet already spent) ends the game.
